{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Java code to Python 3 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following Java 8 code to Python 3 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original Java 8 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class Test {\n    int r, c;\n    Scanner in = new Scanner(System.in);\n    long[][] C = new long[64][64];\n    long best = Long.MAX_VALUE;\n    int[][] pref = new int[2][64];\n    Map<Long, Long> memo = new HashMap<>();\n    String path;\n\n    void dfs(long x, long y, int v1, int v2) {\n        long d = Math.abs(x - y);\n        if (best <= 1 || d - C[v1][r] * C[v2][r] >= best) return;\n        if (v1 == r - 1 && v2 == r - 1) {\n            if (d < best) best = d;\n            return;\n        }\n        if (v1 >= r) {\n            long c1 = C[v1][r] - C[v1 - 1][r], s2 = C[v2][r];\n            dfs(x, y + c1 * s2, v1 - 1, v2);\n        }\n        if (v2 >= r) {\n            long s1 = C[v1][r], c2 = C[v2][r] - C[v2 - 1][r];\n            dfs(x + s1 * c2, y, v1, v2 - 1);\n        }\n    }\n\n    long solve(long x, long y, int v1, int v2) {\n        long k = x * 10000 + v1 * 100 + v2;\n        Long v = memo.get(k);\n        if (v != null) return v;\n        v = 0L;\n        long d = Math.abs(x - y);\n        if (d - C[v1][r] * C[v2][r] > best) {\n            memo.put(k, v);\n            return v;\n        }\n        if (v1 < r || v2 < r) {\n            int sum = v1 + v2;\n            if (v1 >= pref[0][sum] && v2 >= pref[1][sum]) {\n                v1 -= pref[0][sum];\n                v2 -= pref[1][sum];\n                v = C[v1 + v2][v1];\n                memo.put(k, v);\n                return v;\n            }\n            memo.put(k, v);\n            return v;\n        }\n        char c = path.charAt(v1 + v2 - 1);\n        if (c != 'B') {\n            long c1 = C[v1][r] - C[v1 - 1][r], s2 = C[v2][r];\n            v += solve(x, y + c1 * s2, v1 - 1, v2);\n        }\n        if (c != 'A') {\n            long s1 = C[v1][r], c2 = C[v2][r] - C[v2 - 1][r];\n            v += solve(x + s1 * c2, y, v1, v2 - 1);\n        }\n        memo.put(k, v);\n        return v;\n    }\n\n    void run() {\n        r = in.nextInt(); c = in.nextInt(); in.nextLine();\n        path = in.nextLine();\n        int n = 2 * (r + c);\n        for (int i = 0; i <= n; i++)\n            for (int j = 0; j <= n; j++) {\n                if (j == 0) C[i][j] = 1;\n                else if (i == 0) C[i][j] = 0;\n                else C[i][j] = C[i - 1][j - 1] + C[i - 1][j];\n            }\n        int v1 = r + c, v2 = r + c;\n        long x = 0, y = 0;\n        while (v1 >= r && v2 >= r) {\n            if (x > y) {\n                long c1 = C[v1][r] - C[v1 - 1][r], s2 = C[v2][r];\n                y += c1 * s2;\n                v1--;\n            } else {\n                long s1 = C[v1][r], c2 = C[v2][r] - C[v2 - 1][r];\n                x += s1 * c2;\n                v2--;\n            }\n        }\n        best = Math.abs(x - y);\n        dfs(0, 0, r + c, r + c);\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n            pref[0][i + 1] = pref[0][i] + (path.charAt(i) == 'A' ? 1 : 0);\n            pref[1][i + 1] = pref[1][i] + (path.charAt(i) == 'B' ? 1 : 0);\n        }\n        long ans = solve(0, 0, r + c, r + c);\n        System.out.println(ans);\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        new Test().run();\n    }\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport sys\n\nclass Test:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.r = 0\n        self.c = 0\n        self.C = [[0] * 64 for _ in range(64)]\n        self.best = 10**18  # large number\n        self.pref = [[0] * 64 for _ in range(2)]\n        self.memo = {}\n        self.path = \"\"\n\n    def dfs(self, x, y, v1, v2):\n        d = abs(x - y)\n        if self.best <= 1 or d - self.C[v1][self.r] * self.C[v2][self.r] >= self.best:\n            return\n        if v1 == self.r - 1 and v2 == self.r - 1:\n            if d < self.best:\n                self.best = d\n            return\n        if v1 >= self.r:\n            c1 = self.C[v1][self.r] - self.C[v1 - 1][self.r]\n            s2 = self.C[v2][self.r]\n            self.dfs(x, y + c1 * s2, v1 - 1, v2)\n        if v2 >= self.r:\n            s1 = self.C[v1][self.r]\n            c2 = self.C[v2][self.r] - self.C[v2 - 1][self.r]\n            self.dfs(x + s1 * c2, y, v1, v2 - 1)\n\n    def solve(self, x, y, v1, v2):\n        k = x * 10000 + v1 * 100 + v2\n        v = self.memo.get(k)\n        if v is not None:\n            return v\n        v = 0\n        d = abs(x - y)\n        if d - self.C[v1][self.r] * self.C[v2][self.r] > self.best:\n            self.memo[k] = v\n            return v\n        if v1 < self.r or v2 < self.r:\n            s = v1 + v2\n            if v1 >= self.pref[0][s] and v2 >= self.pref[1][s]:\n                v1 -= self.pref[0][s]\n                v2 -= self.pref[1][s]\n                v = self.C[v1 + v2][v1]\n                self.memo[k] = v\n                return v\n            self.memo[k] = v\n            return v\n        c = self.path[v1 + v2 - 1]\n        if c != 'B':\n            c1 = self.C[v1][self.r] - self.C[v1 - 1][self.r]\n            s2 = self.C[v2][self.r]\n            v += self.solve(x, y + c1 * s2, v1 - 1, v2)\n        if c != 'A':\n            s1 = self.C[v1][self.r]\n            c2 = self.C[v2][self.r] - self.C[v2 - 1][self.r]\n            v += self.solve(x + s1 * c2, y, v1, v2 - 1)\n        self.memo[k] = v\n        return v\n\n    def run(self):\n        data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n        self.r = int(data[0])\n        self.c = int(data[1])\n        self.path = data[2]\n        n = 2 * (self.r + self.c)\n        # compute binomial coefficients up to n\n        for i in range(n + 1):\n            for j in range(n + 1):\n                if j == 0:\n                    self.C[i][j] = 1\n                elif i == 0:\n                    self.C[i][j] = 0\n                else:\n                    self.C[i][j] = self.C[i - 1][j - 1] + self.C[i - 1][j]\n        v1 = self.r + self.c\n        v2 = self.r + self.c\n        x = 0\n        y = 0\n        while v1 >= self.r and v2 >= self.r:\n            if x > y:\n                c1 = self.C[v1][self.r] - self.C[v1 - 1][self.r]\n                s2 = self.C[v2][self.r]\n                y += c1 * s2\n                v1 -= 1\n            else:\n                s1 = self.C[v1][self.r]\n                c2 = self.C[v2][self.r] - self.C[v2 - 1][self.r]\n                x += s1 * c2\n                v2 -= 1\n        self.best = abs(x - y)\n        self.dfs(0, 0, self.r + self.c, self.r + self.c)\n        for i in range(n):\n            self.pref[0][i + 1] = self.pref[0][i] + (1 if self.path[i] == 'A' else 0)\n            self.pref[1][i + 1] = self.pref[1][i] + (1 if self.path[i] == 'B' else 0)\n        ans = self.solve(0, 0, self.r + self.c, self.r + self.c)\n        print(ans)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    sys.setrecursionlimit(10000)\n    Test().run()\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.0015101945027709007, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -0.0002858230145648122, -8.868777513271198e-05, 0.0, -0.3868763744831085, -0.0141702657